        {
          "text": "BilledCost and EffectiveCost are in billing currency; PricingCurrency can be Atlas Credits. PricingCurrencyEffectiveCost preserves cost in pricing currency, consistent with FOCUS's virtual-currency model. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/focus-report.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:76bf4ecb95942bf5d918d9fcdc611b5b12fda1e77c007af7be59e85cbe15c212",
