          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas maps legacy CSV Amount and JSON totalPriceCents to PricingCurrencyEffectiveCost; CSV Unit Price and JSON unitPriceDollars map to PricingCurrencyListUnitPrice. These are documented field correspondences, not proof of identical numeric units. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/focus-report.md",
