        },
        {
          "text": "FOCUS 1.3 defines PricingCurrencyEffectiveCost after discounts and allocated prepaid purchases, denominated in PricingCurrency; it must be zero on prepaid-purchase or previous-usage purchase rows. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://focus.finops.org/docs/specification/v1-3/columns/cost-and-usage/pricing-currency-effective-cost/",
